# The vendored three-doom port, and the shareware IWAD it loads. Kept on disk, served on the
# machines, and packed into a release -- but not in git. The port is GPL v2 and this repository
# carries its own license; the WAD carries no redistribution grant at all. Either one inside a
# published repository would be a distribution of somebody else's work under our terms.
# docs/doom.md says how to put both back in a fresh clone.
